# Build profile: minimal.
# GKI baseline + SukiSU integration only. SUSFS is compiled in
# unconditionally with CONFIG_KSU in SukiSU-Nova v3.0.0 (no compile-time
# switch); minimal-ness comes from no KPM, no candidate tunables and no
# runtime SUSFS list. See docs/phase1/BUILD_PROFILES.md.

# Root framework: built-in SukiSU-Nova (route A). KSU defaults to y in the
# SukiSU Kconfig; set explicitly so the first build is unambiguous.
CONFIG_KSU=y